        <activityName xml:lang="en">Softwood, stand establishment, tending, site development, under bark, holzpur, in forest</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Softwood, stand establishment, tending, site development, under bark, holzpur, in forest
The volume refers to the wood not including the bark. Data on the land use are specific for the Korporation Giswil, which delivers the wood to Walter Küng AG for the production of holzpur elements.;
UUID: 8d7dc3cd-f7e2-3226-9910-3868f05528f9
Includes motormanual processes for stand establishment, tending and site development for spruce and the land and material (including transports) use for the forest roads.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data survey at the Korporation Giswil in Switzerland. 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_8d7dc3cd-f7e2-3226-9910-3868f05528f9.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
